[{"answer":"Good afternoon everybody","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and welcome to Riverside Industrial Village.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/2.mp3"},{"answer":"To start your visit, I'm just going to give you a brief account of the history of the museum","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/3.mp3"},{"answer":"before letting you roam about on your own.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't keep you long. Okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, from where we're standing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/6.mp3"},{"answer":"you've got a good view of the river over there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/7.mp3"},{"answer":"And it was because of this fast-flowing water","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/8.mp3"},{"answer":"that this site was a natural place for manufacturing works.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The water and the availability of raw materials in the area, like minerals and iron ore,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and also the abundance of local fuels, like coal and firewood,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/11.mp3"},{"answer":"all made this site suitable for industry from a very early time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Water was the main source of power for the early industries","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and some of the water wheels were first established in the 12th century, would you believe?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/14.mp3"},{"answer":"At that time, local craftsmen first built an iron forge","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/15.mp3"},{"answer":"just behind the village here, on the bend in the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/16.mp3"},{"answer":"By the 17th and 18th centuries,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/17.mp3"},{"answer":"the region's rivers supported more than 160 water mills -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and many of these continued to operate well into the 19th century.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/19.mp3"},{"answer":"But then, the steam engine was invented","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the railways came","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and the centres of industry were able to move away from the rivers and the countryside and into the towns.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/22.mp3"},{"answer":"So, industrial villages like this one became very rare.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/23.mp3"},{"answer":"So, that's the history for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/24.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like any more information, you can ask me some questions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/25.mp3"},{"answer":"or you can read further in our excellent guide book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'm going to give you a plan of the site","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd just like to point out where everything is","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and then you can take a look at everything for yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I've already pointed out the river, which is on the left.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/30.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, running along the bottom is Woodside Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/31.mp3"},{"answer":"got it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we're standing at the entrance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/34.mp3"},{"answer":"see it at the bottom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and immediately to our right is the Ticket Office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You won't need that because you've got your group booking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/37.mp3"},{"answer":"but just past it are the toilets -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/38.mp3"},{"answer":"always good to know where they are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/39.mp3"},{"answer":"In front of us is the car park, as you can see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and to the left, by the entry gate is the Gift Shop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where you can get copies of the guide, like this one here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, beyond the car park,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/43.mp3"},{"answer":"all the buildings are arranged in a half circle with a yard in the middle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/44.mp3"},{"answer":"The big, stone building at the top is the main Workshop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where the furnace is","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and where all the metal was smelted and the tools were cast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/47.mp3"},{"answer":"as you'll be able to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, in the top right-hand corner,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/49.mp3"},{"answer":"that building with bigger windows is the Showroom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/50.mp3"},{"answer":"where samples of all the tools that were made through the ages are on display.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/51.mp3"},{"answer":"In the top left corner is the Grinding Shop,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/52.mp3"},{"answer":"where the tools were sharpened and finished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And on one side of that you can see the Engine Room","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and on the other is the Café,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/55.mp3"},{"answer":"which isn't an antique, you'll be pleased to know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/56.mp3"},{"answer":"though they do serve very nice old-fashioned teas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/57.mp3"},{"answer":"The row of buildings you can see on the left are the cottages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/58.mp3"},{"answer":"These were built for the workers towards the end of the 18th century","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're still furnished from that period","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/60.mp3"},{"answer":"so you can get a good idea of ordinary people's living conditions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Across the yard from them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/62.mp3"},{"answer":"you can see the stables where the horses were kept for transporting the products.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And the separate building in front of them is the Works Office","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and that still has some of the old accounts on display.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, if anyone wants a guided tour then I'm starting at the Engine Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/66.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like to come along, this way please, ladies and gentlemen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-2-2023-08-10-18-21-02/67.mp3"}]
